CATEGORIES;LANGUAGE=en-US:Program
CONTACT:Parks & Recreation\; 979.764.3486\; parks@cstx.gov
DESCRIPTION:<div class='ai1ec-event-avatar alignleft timely'><img src='http
 s://timelyapp-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/images/54735353/Facebook%20E
 vent%20Images%201_eVSO.png' /></div><p>Set sail on a nautical adventure wi
 th D&D Boundless Blue Campaign\, a beginner-friendly tabletop role-playing
  campaign where you can explore the golden age of piracy and adventure at 
 the Gary Halter Nature Center. </p>\n<p>Create your own character or use a
  premade one as you navigate the high seas. Materials\, snacks and supplie
 s are provided\, and you can continue playing the same character across se
 ssions or switch characters between dates. No previous D&D experience is r
 equired.</p>\n<p>The program is for ages 13 and older. Admission is $5 for
  residents and $6 for non-residents per day. Registration is open through 
 class day.</p>\n<div class='btn' style='margin:0px\;padding:15px\;width:30
 0px\;background-color:#223d92\;text-align:center\;border-radius:5px\;color
 :#ffffff\;'><a style='background-color:transparent\;line-height:inherit\;c
 olor:#ffffff\;text-decoration-line:none\;font-weight:bold\;' href='https:/
 /txcollegestationweb.myvscloud.com/webtrac/web/search.html?Action=Start&Su
 bAction=&csrftoken=&category=ADULT-TEEN&=&primarycode=LCN-97' rel='nofollo
 w noreferrer noopener' target='_blank'>Reserve Your Spot</a></div>\n<p>For
  more information\, contact the Gary Halter Nature Center at 979.764.6216.
 </p>
