 2120684337030702_373625042050832482_n_H863.jpg' /></div><p>Put on your dan
 cing shoes and enjoy an evening of Bachata and Salsa with the local dance 
 community. Whether you’re a seasoned dancer or just starting out\, the hos
 t will guide you on the floor and help you move to the rhythm. The dance i
 s free and open to ages 18 and older.<br /><br />For more information\, co
 ntact the Southwood Community Center at 979.764.6351.</p>
