CONTACT:Parks & Recreation\; 979.764.3486\; parks@cstx.gov
DESCRIPTION:<div class='ai1ec-event-avatar alignleft timely'><img src='http
 s://timelyapp-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/images/54735353/261ee06d-af5
 d-4cab-95e5-8725d32950d8_nOdB.jpg' /></div><p>Get ready for an evening of 
 music\, games and good company! Adults 55 and older are invited to enjoy a
  night of dancing and games Friday\, Nov. 20\, from 6–9 p.m. at the Southw
 ood Community Center.</p>\n<p>Dance to country music and hits from the 196
 0s through the 1980s\, or play cards\, board games or dominoes. Light refr
 eshments will be served. Admission is free.</p>\n<p>For more information o
 n senior programs\, call 979.764.2670 or visit <a href='https://www.cstx.g
 ov/parks-recreation-culture/senior-adult-programs/' rel='nofollow noreferr
 er noopener' target='_blank'>cstx.gov/seniors</a>.</p>
