UID:c241bcc7-c1ee-4420-8dad-9a27a3690565-time.ly
DTSTAMP:20261105T055828Z
CATEGORIES;LANGUAGE=en-US:Event
CONTACT:Planning & Development Services
DESCRIPTION:<div class='ai1ec-event-avatar alignleft timely'><img src='http
 s://timelyapp-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/images/54735353/BannerHarvey
 Road_Vp0e.png' /></div><p>What could the Harvey District look like in the 
 future? Join us for an interactive workshop to explore different ways the 
 district could change\, including options for redevelopment\, housing\, tr
 ansportation\, and public spaces. Building on community input and what we’
 ve learned about the district\, we’ll compare possible scenarios and discu
 ss each option's opportunities and trade-offs. Share what you like\, what 
 concerns you\, and which ideas you think should move forward. Your feedbac
 k will help shape the draft recommendations for the Harvey District Plan. 
 The scenarios are options for discussion\, not final proposals.</p>
DTSTART;TZID=CST6CDT:20261118T180000
DTEND;TZID=CST6CDT:20261118T235959
