BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5e34a055-6e44-4e7e-826b-a61ac2dff665-time.ly
DTSTAMP:20261105T055827Z
CATEGORIES;LANGUAGE=en-US:Event
CONTACT:Neighborhood Services
DESCRIPTION:<div class='ai1ec-event-avatar alignleft timely'><img src='http
 s://timelyapp-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/images/54735353/Seminar_Supp
 ers_Q9jI.jpg' /></div><p>Wondering how your neighborhood\, favorite corrid
 ors\, or community gathering spaces came to be\, or how they might change 
 in the future? Join the Long-Range Planning team from the Planning and Dev
 elopment Services Department to learn the ins and outs of small area plann
 ing!<br /><br />December's Seminar Summer will be a behind-the-scenes look
  at how planners identify focus areas\, engage the public\, develop plan c
 oncepts\, and guide long-term implementation. The evening will conclude wi
 th a Q&A session\, where participants are encouraged to ask questions abou
 t this powerful tool used to shape the future of our city.<br /><br />Smal
 l area plans influence everything from walkability and public spaces to re
 development opportunities\, transportation choices\, and the character of 
 our neighborhoods. As this Seminar Supper\, the planning team will walk yo
 u through:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>What small area planning is and why it matters</
 li>\n<li>How places like Northeast Gateway are being reimagined</li>\n<li>
 How residents and stakeholders play a key role in shaping each plan</li>\n
 <li>Real examples of how community voices have inspired past projects</li>
 \n<li>What's coming next and how YOU can get involved</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Whet
 her you're a long-time resident\, a business owner\, a student\, or just s
 omeone who cares about how College Station grows\, this is a chance to lea
 rn and ask questions in a relaxed\, friendly setting.<br /><br />Come enjo
 y supper\, meet the planners helping to guide our city's future\, and disc
 over how your voice can shape the places we all love. We hope to see you t
 here!</p>\n<p>To register for a Seminar Supper\, please follow this link: 
 <a href='https://airtable.com/appXrenPOgMpfJqUH/shrDUULT6pX7J5zqf' rel='no
 follow noreferrer noopener' target='_blank'>https://airtable.com/appXrenPO
 gMpfJqUH/shrDUULT6pX7J5zqf </a></p>
DTSTART;TZID=CST6CDT:20251208T180000
DTEND;TZID=CST6CDT:20251208T200000
