UID:244827ef-eee3-4b1c-afd4-f43b2d7d45df-time.ly
DTSTAMP:20261105T055827Z
CATEGORIES;LANGUAGE=en-US:Event
CONTACT:Parks & Recreation\; 979.764.3486\; parks@cstx.gov
DESCRIPTION:<div class='ai1ec-event-avatar alignleft timely'><img src='http
 s://timelyapp-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/images/54735353/Facebook%20E
 vents_Cyyk.png' /></div><p>Enjoy a dazzling display of more than one milli
 on Christmas lights at Stephen C. Beachy Central Park! Lights will be on N
 ov. 26–Jan. 1 each night from 6–11 p.m. Admission is free\, and parking is
  available in the park.</p>\n<p>As you stroll or drive through the park\, 
 be sure to tune in to Willy 97.7 FM to enjoy Christmas music provided by B
 ryan Broadcasting.</p>\n<p>Children can send letters to Santa using the No
 rth Pole mailbox outside the Parks and Recreation Administrative Office. L
 etters will be accepted Nov. 26–Dec. 24.</p>\n<p><strong>The park will be 
 closed to vehicles on Dec. 5 as preparations are made for the Christmas in
  the Park event.</strong> The drive-thru closes at 7 a.m. to keep everyone
  safe during setup for visits with Santa\, hayrides\, and plenty of cookie
 s and hot cocoa.</p>\n<p>For more information\, visit <a href='https://www
 .cstx.gov//christmas' rel='nofollow noreferrer noopener' target='_blank'>c
 stx.gov/Christmas</a> or call 979.764.3486.</p>
DTSTART;TZID=CST6CDT:20261126T180000
DTEND;TZID=CST6CDT:20261126T230000
