UID:bf51f056-1eb7-4f8b-9b92-ad31e19a03b8-time.ly
DTSTAMP:20261105T055827Z
CATEGORIES;LANGUAGE=en-US:Program,Event
CONTACT:Parks & Recreation\; 979.764.3486\; parks@cstx.gov
DESCRIPTION:<div class='ai1ec-event-avatar alignleft timely'><img src='http
 s://timelyapp-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/images/54735353/YogaInThePar
 k-FBevent_jQ5v.jpg' /></div><p>Start the morning with a free\, peaceful yo
 ga session for those 18 and older at the Meyer Senior and Community Center
  patio. This welcoming community class is open to all experience levels an
 d includes guided breathing\, gentle warmups\, and variations of Sun Salut
 ation A and B with helpful modifications.</p>\n<p>Whether new to yoga or a
  seasoned yogi\, attendees can enjoy connecting with body\, mind\, and com
 munity. Yoga mats are available while supplies last. Dogs are not allowed.
 <br /><br />For more information\, contact the Meyer Senior and Community 
 Center at 979.764.2670.</p>
DTSTART;TZID=CST6CDT:20260822T080000
DTEND;TZID=CST6CDT:20260822T090000
