 a.jpg' /></div><p>Enjoy tasty bites from local food trucks\, live music an
 d yard games at the Wolf Pen Creek Festival Site. Admission is free\, and 
 food is available for purchase. Pets\, alcohol and glass containers are no
 t allowed. Free parking is available at the Meyer Senior and Community Cen
 ter and Post Oak Mall.</p>\n<p>Check Facebook (<a href='https://www.facebo
 ok.com/CSTXparks/' rel='nofollow noreferrer noopener' target='_blank'>/CST
 Xparks</a>) and Instagram (<a href='https://www.instagram.com/cstxparks/' 
 rel='nofollow noreferrer noopener' target='_blank'>@CSTXparks</a>) the Mon
 day before each event for the list of food trucks.<br /><br />For more inf
 ormation\, contact the Parks and Recreation Administrative Office at 979.7
 64.3486. </p>
