 b-43e5-b5fc-f5aedeb302c5_erzB.jpg' /></div><p>A quiet\, inclusive swim tim
 e at Cindy Hallaran Pool for individuals and families who prefer a calmer 
 environment. Music is lowered and lifeguard whistles are used only in emer
 gencies\, allowing participants to swim\, play and socialize at their own 
 pace. Coast Guard-approved life vests are allowed and available for use.</
 p>\n<p>Admission is $4 per person. Ages 12 and under are free.</p>\n<p>For
  more information\, contact Cindy Hallaran Pool at 979.764.3787.</p>
