 8-49ca-85ff-c6cf41387d7b_H7oO.jpg' /></div><p>Dance\, sweat and have fun a
 s an instructor guides you through lively\, Latin-inspired moves designed 
 to boost your fitness and mood. This class is open to ages 16 and older of
  all fitness levels\, from beginners to seasoned dancers. Admission is fre
 e.</p>\n<p>The class will be held outdoors at the W.A. Tarrow Pavilion\, a
 djacent to the Lincoln Recreation Center. In case of inclement weather\, i
 t will move indoors. Participants are encouraged to bring a water bottle.<
 /p>\n<p>For more information\, call the Lincoln Recreation Center at 979.7
 64.3779.</p>
