DESCRIPTION:<div class='ai1ec-event-avatar alignleft timely'><img src='http
 s://timelyapp-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/images/54735353/Copy%20of%20
 Parks%20Event%20-%20Summer%20Template%202_G3IM.png' /></div><p>Learn the b
 asics of sewing at First Stitches: Sewing for Beginners\, a hands-on cours
 e led by SEWN by Sisters seamstress Nancy Johnson. The class covers thread
 ing a needle\, using a sewing machine\, understanding fabrics and completi
 ng simple projects. No experience is needed. Participants are encouraged t
 o bring their own sewing machine\, as access to available machines will be
  limited.</p>\n<p>The class will be held Saturday\, Nov. 7\, from 9 a.m.–n
 oon at the Lincoln Recreation Center. The program is for ages 16 and older
  and costs $10 for residents and $12 for non-residents. Registration ends 
 Monday\, Nov. 2.</p>\n<div class='btn' style='margin:0px\;padding:15px\;wi
 dth:300px\;background-color:#223d92\;text-align:center\;border-radius:5px\
 ;color:#ffffff\;'><a style='background-color:transparent\;line-height:inhe
 rit\;color:#ffffff\;text-decoration-line:none\;font-weight:bold\;' href='h
 ttps://txcollegestationweb.myvscloud.com/webtrac/web/search.html?Action=St
 art&SubAction=&csrftoken=&category=ADULT-TEEN&=&primarycode=LRC-29' rel='n
 ofollow noreferrer noopener' target='_blank'>Reserve Your Spot</a></div>\n
 <p>For more information\, contact the Lincoln Recreation Center at 979.764
 .3486.</p>
